  "description": "Simple .NET library capable of tracking users across re-installs and hardware components swapping, and even entirely new computer using the neighborhood's network endpoints.",
  "id": "HardwareIds.NET",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-10-06T09:38:13.32Z",
